WEBVTT

00:10:38.303 --> 00:10:40.949
♪ E eu ficaria aqui para sempre ♪

00:10:42.449 --> 00:10:44.507
♪ mas a minha casa ♪

00:10:45.634 --> 00:10:48.604
♪ é ligeiramente longe demais ♪

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:51.336
♪ deste lugar ♪

00:10:52.227 --> 00:10:55.360
♪ Eu juro que tentei ♪

00:10:56.463 --> 00:10:58.983
♪ abrandar♪